{"last_link_id": 42, "nodes": [{"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [24], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "segments_alignment", "label": "segments_alignment", "type": "whisper_alignment", "localized_name": "segments_alignment"}, {"name": "words_alignment", "label": "words_alignment", "type": "whisper_alignment", "localized_name": "words_alignment"}], "size": [270, 146], "pos": [-832.1812133789062, 300.9813232421875], "widgets_values": ["whisper-large-v3", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 11, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "shape": 7, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "Apply Whisper", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Whisper", "ver": "c67c040559c013833dedb0737df14182dc5043cc", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Apply Whisper"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["audio/FishAudio"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 25, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudio", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [270, 112], "pos": [-108.39970397949219, 85.97683715820312], "id": 23, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n# 语音控制标签中英对照表\n\n## 发声\n| 英文标签 | 中文翻译 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `[laugh]` | 笑（单次） |\n| `[laughing]` | 大笑 / 持续发笑 |\n| `[chuckle]` | 轻笑 / 抿嘴笑 |\n| `[chuckling]` | 轻笑不止 |\n| `[tsk]` | 啧（不满 / 不耐烦的咂舌声） |\n| `[clearing throat]` | 清嗓子 |\n\n## 语气\n| 英文标签 | 中文翻译 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `[professional broadcast tone]` | 专业播音腔 |\n| `[singing]` | 歌唱 / 吟唱 |\n| `[with strong accent]` | 浓重口音 |\n\n## 表达\n| 英文标签 | 中文翻译 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `[moaning]` | 呻吟 |\n| `[panting]` | 喘息 / 气喘 |\n| `[echo]` | 带回声效果 |\n| `[pitch up]` | 音调升高 |\n| `[pitch down]` | 音调降低 |\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [320.58935546875, 757.1656494140625], "pos": [-2216.48486328125, 114.01168823242188], "id": 31, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n# 语音控制标签中英对照表\n\n## 情感\n| 英文标签 | 中文翻译 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `[excited]` | 兴奋的 |\n| `[sad]` | 悲伤的 |\n| `[angry]` | 愤怒的 |\n| `[surprised]` | 惊讶的 |\n| `[delight]` | 愉悦的 |\n\n## 音量\n| 英文标签 | 中文翻译 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `[whisper]` | 耳语 / 轻声细语 |\n| `[low voice]` | 低声 / 小声 |\n| `[volume up]` | 音量提升 |\n| `[loud]` | 大声的 |\n| `[shouting]` | 呼喊 / 叫嚷 |\n| `[screaming]` | 尖叫 / 嘶吼 |\n\n## 节奏\n| 英文标签 | 中文翻译 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `[pause]` | 停顿 |\n| `[short pause]` | 短暂停顿 |\n| `[inhale]` | 吸气 |\n| `[exhale]` | 呼气 |\n| `[sigh]` | 叹气 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [311.3904113769531, 749.4999389648438], "pos": [-2591.973388671875, 115.17356872558594], "id": 28, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# FishAudioS2 ComfyUI 节点参数说明\n\n| 参数名 | 详细说明 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `model_path` | 模型文件的存放位置，必须放到 `ComfyUI/models/fishaudioS2/` 这个文件夹里，不然程序找不到模型。 |\n| `text` | 你要转成语音的文字内容，还能加情感标签，比如 `[sad]` 悲伤、`[excited]` 兴奋，让语音更有情绪。 |\n| `language` | 语音的语言，可选自动识别（`auto`）、英文（`en`）、中文（`zh`）、日语（`ja`）、韩语（`ko`），选对了发音更准。 |\n| `device` | 用什么硬件跑模型：自动（`auto`）、显卡（`cuda`，N卡专用）、CPU、Mac的M系列（`mps`），优先选 `cuda` 速度最快。 |\n| `precision` | 模型计算精度，选 `bfloat16`/`float16` 更省显存、速度快，`float32` 精度最高但更吃显存，一般用16位就行。 |\n| `attention` | 注意力机制的实现方式，`auto` 自动选最优，`sdpa`/`sage_attention`/`flash_attention` 是不同加速算法，不用纠结，默认 `auto` 就行。 |\n| `max_new_tokens` | 生成语音的最大长度，填0就是自动判断长度，不用手动算。 |\n| `chunk_length` | 把长文本切成小段处理的长度，范围100-400，以后版本会删掉，暂时不用管它。 |\n| `temperature` | 采样“自由度”，0.1最保守、发音稳定，1.0最放飞、变化多，一般0.6-0.8比较均衡。 |\n| `top_p` | 控制候选词的范围，0.1只选最靠谱的，1.0全放开，和 `temperature` 搭配调，一般0.7-0.9就行。 |\n| `repetition_penalty` | 防止语音重复啰嗦，数值越大越不容易重复，范围0.9-2.0，太大会发音生硬，推荐1.1-1.3。 |\n| `seed` | 随机种子，固定同一个数字，相同输入能生成一模一样的语音，方便复现效果。 |\n| `keep_model_loaded` | 模型加载后一直留在显存里，下次生成不用重新加载，省时间但占显存，显够就开。 |\n| `compile_model` | 用PyTorch编译加速模型，只有Linux系统能用，Windows/Mac直接忽略这个选项。 |"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [748.6239013671875, 751.8267822265625], "pos": [-1839.1043701171875, 115.50233459472656], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [25], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [372.9955749511719, 547.8670654296875], "pos": [-517.3165893554688, 82.91378021240234], "widgets_values": ["s2-pro", "Hello! [chuckle] This is my cloned voice. 猜猜看？这就是我的克隆声音啦！ねえねえ、当ててみて！これが僕のクローンボイスだよ！", "auto", "cuda", "bfloat16", "sage_attention", 0, 200, 0.8, 0.8, 1.1, 666, "fixed", true, false, "", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "reference_audio", "link": 23, "label": "reference_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "reference_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_path"}, "name": "model_path", "label": "model_path", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_